                    "developerAttribution": "Cold Symmetry ",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Playstack Ltd",
                    "description": "**Possess Lost Warriors **\nThe lost remains of defeated warriors are yours to discover. Awaken these Mortal Shells, occupy their bodies, and master unique combat styles.\n\n**Iron Sharpens Iron**\nCombat is strategic, deliberate, and unforgiving. Commit your sword only when an opportunity opens.\n\n**Face Formidable Foes**\nYour path is guarded by adversaries, devoted to inscrutable gods. Behold creatures both pitiable and grotesque and muster your courage and face them down.",
                    "shortDescription": "Mortal Shell is a deep action-RPG that tests your sanity and resilience in a shattered world. Your adversaries spare no mercy, with survival demanding superior awareness and precision. Possess lost warriors, discover hidden sanctums, and face formidable foes.",
